<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>TAPSO</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>com.lucanomics.tapso</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>tapso</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>알림을 켠 정류장에 가까워지면 앱을 열지 않아도 탈 버스가 어디쯤인지 알려 드려요. 정류장 근처인지는 iPhone 안에서만 판단하고 위치는 탑서 서버로 보내지 않아요.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>버스를 따라가는 데는 위치가 필요 없어요. 허용하면 승차 중 위치 확인, 정류장 알림, ‘앱을 나가도 계속 알려 주기’에만 iPhone 안에서 써요. 위치는 탑서 서버로 보내지 않아요.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>스크린샷 원본을 사진 앱에서 지울 때만 써요. / Used only to delete a screenshot's original from Photos when you ask.</string>
	<key>NSSupportsLiveActivities</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UIAppFonts</key>
	<array>
		<string>Pretendard-Regular.otf</string>
		<string>Pretendard-SemiBold.otf</string>
		<string>Pretendard-ExtraBold.otf</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIApplicationSceneManifest</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes</key>
		<false/>
	</dict>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>location</string>
	</array>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
